  "notes": [
    "**Creer** is an -ER verb with spelling changes",
    "Present: regular -ER conjugation",
    "Preterite: spelling change i→y in 3rd person (creyó, creyeron), accents on other forms (creí, creíste, creímos)",
    "Imperfect: regular -ER pattern with accent on \"í\" (creía, creías, etc.)",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: past participle **creído** with accent",
    "Future: regular future endings attached to infinitive",
    "Condicional: regular conditional endings attached to infinitive",
    "Similar pattern to **leer** (to read) and **caer** (to fall)",
    "Often used with \"en\": *creer en algo/alguien* (to believe in something/someone)",
    "Can also mean \"to think\": *Creo que sí* (I think so)",
    "Common usage: *No lo creo* (I don't believe it), *creer en Dios* (to believe in God)",
    "Related noun: **la creencia** (belief)"
  ],
